ision quality, and crew atmosphere positive, which is important. The communication difficulty could be mitigated with training. Also not willing to further education is a concern for adaptability. But maybe still best.\n\nThus I will recommend Candidate C, but note concerns.\n\nWe need to reference existing discussion (none). We can say \"Given we are starting, I propose...\"\n\nLet's produce."}
